phorylation of AKT2 substrates (By similarity). Participates in transferrin receptor endocytosis (PubMed:16873553)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}